solution_md:
[color=#000]After reflecting **M** over line  $q$  it will result in: 
[asy]
usepackage("newtxtext");
label(" $p$ ", (-1,0),NE);
label(" $q$ ", (-0.75,-0.75), N*1.5);
size(3cm);
draw((-1,0)--(1,0)); draw((0,-1)--(0,1)); label(rotate(270)*" $\textbf{\textsf{M}}$ ",(0.6,0.25));
draw((-0.8,-0.8)--(0.8,0.8),linewidth(1.1)); 
[/asy]

Then, reflecting the above **M** over line  $p$  would be:
[asy]
usepackage("newtxtext");
label(" $p$ ", (-1,0),NE);
label(" $q$ ", (-0.75,-0.75), N*1.5);
size(3cm);
draw((-1,0)--(1,0)); draw((0,-1)--(0,1)); label(rotate(270)*" $\textbf{\textsf{M}}$ ",(0.6,-0.25));
draw((-0.8,-0.8)--(0.8,0.8),linewidth(1.1)); 
[/asy]

So, the answer is  $\boxed{\textbf{E}}$ .

