Consider these two operations:
\begin{align*}
a \, \blacklozenge \, b &= a^2 - b^2
a \, \bigstar \, b &= (a - b)^2
\end{align*}
What is the value of  $(5 \, \blacklozenge \, 3) \, \bigstar \, 6?$  $\textbf{(A) } {-}20\qquad\textbf{(B) } 4\qquad\textbf{(C) } 16\qquad\textbf{(D) } 100\qquad\textbf{(E) } 220$

